cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "OCTD: Oracle-Calibrated Three-layer Predictability-Ceiling Decomposition for Knowledge Tracing"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible diagnostic framework (OCE/OCTD) that decomposes the
  predictability ceiling of knowledge-tracing models into three layers
  (I Oracle upper bound, II extractable ceiling, III real model) and maps
  the improvement bottleneck to data-side (A), feature-side (B), or
  model-side (C) causes via two decision rules and cross-distribution
  calibration.
